00:04:14.050 --> 00:04:16.300
So these are different--
they're very high level-- how

00:04:16.300 --> 00:04:18.190
data comes in, how
it's transformed,

00:04:18.190 --> 00:04:20.901
and where it goes once
you're done with it.

00:04:24.150 --> 00:04:25.848
Last slide from the
