00:04:55.850 --> 00:04:58.280
in certain formats, so it's
actually hard to use and hard

00:04:58.280 --> 00:04:59.210
to automate.

00:04:59.210 --> 00:05:01.160
So how do you get
that standardized fix,

00:05:01.160 --> 00:05:02.410
so that you can use it inside?

00:05:05.990 --> 00:05:08.750
Next is data science and
machine learning, right?

00:05:08.750 --> 00:05:10.340
So this is not
just for analysts.

00:05:10.340 --> 00:05:10.840
All right.

00:05:10.840 --> 00:05:13.640
Oftentimes, data scientists
are using our Dataprep,

00:05:13.640 --> 00:05:16.260
because if you want
to train your model,

00:05:16.260 --> 00:05:17.630
you really want well--

00:05:17.630 --> 00:05:19.850
you want well-structured,
clean data in order

00:05:19.850 --> 00:05:22.216
to be most efficient
with these projects.

00:05:22.216 --> 00:05:23.990
And the last one is
